[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: VeloSim toolchain and standalone schematic requirements

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: VELO-TOOLCHAIN-NET11-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Released .NET 11 toolchain
STATEMENT: >>>
Maintained VeloSim C# projects and included schematic projects shall build with
released SDK 11.0.100 and target net11.0. SDK selection, framework-dependent
paths, package locks, examples and build instructions shall agree. Verification
shall distinguish successful compilation, runtime execution and unavailable
native/platform coverage. The RC SDK shall not be required by this repository.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: VELO-SCHEMATIC-OWNERSHIP-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Versioned schematic subproject
STATEMENT: >>>
The complete schematic source, requirements, tests, UI, solver adapter and MCP
host shall reside under apps/SchematicLab in VeloSim. Import shall retain its
history and stable requirements/command identifiers. Existing checkout data
shall not be discarded. Core shall remain independent of UI and HDL engines.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: VELO-SCHEMATIC-STANDALONE-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Relocatable standalone web application
STATEMENT: >>>
A standalone schematic distribution shall contain its server and published
browser assets, and shall run outside the source checkout without building
the HDL simulator. Its default assets shall resolve relative to the installed
application, independent of current working directory. Packaging shall record
file hashes, runtime requirements and any included external solver provenance.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: VELO-SCHEMATIC-STARTUP-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Typed bounded startup commands
STATEMENT: >>>
Startup shall parse bounded explicit arguments into serve, help or error
commands. Duplicate or unknown options, missing values, invalid numeric ports
and invalid explicit paths shall fail before starting a server. Help shall
not require assets or a solver and shall not open interactive dialogs.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: VELO-SCHEMATIC-LOOPBACK-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Local host boundary
STATEMENT: >>>
The standalone server shall listen only on localhost at an explicitly validated
port in 1024..65535, defaulting to 5087. It shall retain the 64 KiB request-body
bound and existing typed command validation, revision checks and structured
solver refusals. CLI configuration shall not enable public network binding.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: VELO-SCHEMATIC-SOLVER-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Explicit native solver availability
STATEMENT: >>>
The distribution may include an explicitly selected trusted solver with its
SHA-256 and source provenance, or accept an explicit absolute solver path.
A missing optional solver shall preserve schematic editing and the analytical
divider while native analyses return an explicit unavailable result. Missing
model providers or numerical outputs shall never be replaced with invented
successful results. Browser and MCP shall retain the shared command contracts.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: VELO-CSHARP-AUDIT-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Evidence-based language modernization
STATEMENT: >>>
The migration shall document useful C# features adopted or already present and
their verified scope. Changes shall preserve public wire contracts and error,
cancellation and resource semantics. New syntax alone shall not establish a
performance improvement. Inapplicable or incompatible features shall be
documented rather than introduced solely for feature-count claims.
<<<
